<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have deployed F-16 jets to the Tak border and are reviewing policy after construction vehicles were torched in Yala and attacks continued in three southern provinces. The Thai foreign minister met Myanmar leader Min Aung Hlaing to discuss border security and arsenic-tainted rivers, while Cambodia’s military recruitment drive exceeded its target by 50%. A roadside bomb injured three students on a school van and an 18‑wheel lorry crash in Prachin Buri killed three women. Diphtheria cases have been reported in Thailand in 2026. Bank of England, Singapore and Thailand completed a cross-border FX settlement trial. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPYko2TXRuRkZsdy04WmdzaW95MzJCTjdfVjFiS1llRGEzOHJCbWpXS1ZTcFJNeS1RVlNRN1RDd2F6OVdYeTVBaHNITWFJX3ZPRkdwVDhiV0tsOFk1eEk3ZkZUSFVnTTN5Tm9pa05qQWZuaUFuYWhGbW5PekxvRGxkUTJfT0VzTmU2Q2VZLVJtd2E3cXVrdml2WjdISkJtNWV5eXZDS2pQc1c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Dazzling Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOS2dxa3BjSXFxcktBbjFhbkZYNEVhMVdYMjFUeDZwSUNfZUluRDJpODlBem9OQU9QZVhIXzN1V3g3RVJoREVVSkg4b0RKSTg3ZTZ2TS1PWFlKQU9kNUgtN3hWa2d5NUE0R0xOVnJDV3VhM2ltRklMMkx5d3lpU1Bza0JnVXdxczVDNFdfRmFWcjR1RElpUTF5dm5DTm1FblYyMTdNdGRUTGJ6TVJUT3h1TTB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOZGo1SmdmVkloVDczTFItUkg0aVlJamU2NE1OLUpibUk2Rm9ZYTE0NjdRNFRoM3hQZHlkU1hlSnZWc3JPMTRVMktfdDdhMDB3MFc1UVZDeElNOF9KUzBpZTd6UzV1RDBYaEdXZlZpLVhXSlZZSWl4RHZ4QkJYQjlnMV95Um5XYTlWLWNUVjVmQWp5eEZzT29ybWRmdXFZUkxBWmUtYjNWYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;CoinDesk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE1lQlZhbkNZSkZjc3E3NmhI